WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:50.480
THE TEAM BATTLE BEGINS

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:51.400
Nova!

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:55.320
I guess it was a good lesson.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.070
Here's a lesson to take with you.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:03.240
In this world,
there's always someone stronger.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.040
Well... goodbye!

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.330
Nova!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.380
At least die gloriously, you loser!

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:13.840
No!

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:27.180
You talk too much.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.810
But you were right about one thing.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.860
There's always someone stronger!

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.280
Hyunckel!

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.410
Maam! Big Guy!

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.880
Rushing while carrying three was rough.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.840
You can rest for a while.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.340
-Crocodine!
-Right!

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:04.350
Yow, ow, ow!

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.730
Be a little more gentle, Big Guy.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.810
Thank you! But be careful!

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.230
They're really strong!

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.950
So all the Disciples of Avan are here.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:25.330
I suppose we can't back down anymore.

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:26.950
Look Dai.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.830
I impaled his head and he still lives.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.040
They really are just like Flazzard.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.550
They're metallic lifeforms
made by Forbidden Magic.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:46.300
If we find their cores and use
our Air technique, they can be defeated.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:49.180
That's right. We just need
to find their cores!

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.180
Don't bother searching!

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.310
Our cores are right here!

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:56.730
The same as you humans.

00:03:56.900 --> 00:04:00.570
Is he an idiot?!
He just revealed their weakness!

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:03.280
Knowing that won't help you can beat us.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:07.830
Just like you humans,
it's meaningless if you can't hit it!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.790
This makes it five against five.
We're evenly matched.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:16.170
As a reward for impaling me,
let us show you...

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:21.760
the true power of the Hadlar Royal Guard!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.760
Their confidence is almost terrifying.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.010
So what?!

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:31.270
After all we've been through,
our teamwork won't lose to those puppets!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.560
Maam, try to take care of that horse-head.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:39.690
Without his spell reflector,
I can blow them all away

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:42.150
with my Extreme Spell!

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.780
Got it!

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:49.120
I'll take the big one.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.370
Dai, which one is their leader?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:58.000
Hadlar isn't here, so that queen
should be their leader.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.380
Got it.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:05.090
I'll be taking the armoured one, Albinass.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:08.970
You will not, Hym.
You must take the Hero, Dai.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:13.270
What? You're telling me
to just ignore what he did to me?

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:16.520
I won't be happy
until I impale his head, too!

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:20.190
We are all pieces for Lord Hadlar.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:23.860
We live and die all for Lord Hadlar.

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:25.490
Don't forget that.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.320
I guess I can't argue with that.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:35.620
If you're going to fight, revealing their
strengths will better serve Lord Hadlar.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:40.770
Whoa!

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:51.660
Very well, then!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:58.290
You've got to know when to switch gears!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.210
I'm taking the Hero!

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.130
Frizz!

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:20.020
<i>That's it, Hym. Keep it up.</i>

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.190
Are you my opponent?

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:29.610
How confident. You could have
pierced my core from behind.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.450
Are you a woman?

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.990
No need for concern.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.700
I am merely a piece
bearing the role of queen.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:43.000
A piece has no gender.
No need to hold back.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.710
You're pretty brave.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.800
But I think you underestimate us.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.550
That one must be a pawn.

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:55.970
Did you think pitting the weakest piece
against Dai would actually stop him?

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:59.390
You're the one underestimating us.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:05.020
Excuse me, but I believe you're unfamiliar
with the game of chess.

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:08.650
In chess, there are no stronger
or weaker pieces.

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.860
There is only a difference in abilities.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:16.030
A pawn is not necessarily
weaker than a queen.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.580
It's all in how you use it.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:22.580
Recognize your opponent's abilities
and deploy your pieces accordingly.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:27.630
It's the basic strategy in chess
to stop your enemy.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.760
<i>Right there!</i>

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.470
<i>If I can hit the heart with Air Slash...!</i>

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:39.640
Now!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:42.730
Avan Style Sword Technique! Air Slash!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:53.030
If you're using this knife against me,
you still don't understand my power.

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.410
Or is that thing on your back
just a decoration?

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.950
Well?!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.240
Dai!

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:06.080
Hym is unmatched
in close-quarters combat.

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:10.590
Without your Hero, it seems
you're the ones at a disadvantage.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.110
<i>I can't shatter that shield.</i>

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:32.530
<i>I need to stop his movements!</i>

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:37.780
For a human to attain such speed
is quite a feat.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:38.990
The speed...!

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:43.870
However...

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:49.880
no one can eclipse my agility and speed!

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:55.090
I appears that our piece placement
was better than yours.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:59.800
Then I merely need to take out
the queen who commands them!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:02.680
<i>What?!</i>

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:07.850
It hardly bears mentioning,
but I, too, am very strong.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:12.980
This is bad!
They're controlling the battle!

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:17.900
I need them grouped together,
otherwise I can't cast my spell.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:19.530
What can we do?!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:24.490
And where did that pointy guy
who was chasing me go?

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:25.750
Right here!

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.670
You're wide open!

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:31.460
You bastard!

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.090
My brand-new staff!

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:39.510
Over 80% of my body is blades.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:41.930
I wouldn't suggest touching me.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:45.060
Get back! Don't touch me!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.350
Popp!

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:52.020
Come on! You don't have time
to be worried about others!

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.520
Darn it!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.820
<i>It won't come out!</i>

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:06.330
What a disappointment!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.670
Don't carry around a weapon
that you can't even use!

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:16.590
It appears that he hasn't yet
mastered that sword.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:22.010
It seems that we need not bother
summoning Lord Hadlar.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.180
Don't be so sure about that!

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:31.350
<i>Impossible! He actually hit me?!</i>

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:35.190
Unfortunately, we humans aren't pieces.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:40.860
Don't think you can
approach this like a game.

00:11:41.570 --> 00:11:42.530
Sizz!

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:46.830
Futile, futile!

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:58.500
Everyone!

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:01.840
Draw it. This is your last chance.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:08.850
<i>At this rate, everyone is going to die!</i>

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:14.310
<i>If I could draw my sword,
I could defeat them easily!</i>

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:17.730
<i>Darn it! Why won't it come out?!</i>

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:23.280
What a joke. You really can't draw it.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:26.570
You're not worth Lord Hadlar's time.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:32.290
My Heat Knuckle can easily shatter
someone like you.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:36.330
Time to finish things.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:42.970
Don't worry. I'll take your head
before you feel any pain.

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.050
Nova?!

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:50.390
Curse you, you feeble weakling!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:54.480
Quick! Give me your staff!

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:57.810
It's over!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:07.910
Nova!

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.200
Thank you for saving me, Nova!

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.910
Don't bother thanking me.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.620
It's a Hero's duty to protect the weak.

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.500
Don't worry. He's just unconscious.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:26.510
He exhausted himself
by using up the last of his Aura.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:31.970
He fought to the very limit.
He's tougher than I thought.

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:36.230
To the very limit!

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.480
REFRACTOR FIST

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:47.490
DARK PUPPETRY AURA HAND

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.330
It's no good!

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:57.420
All this training and I couldn't
draw my sword once!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:03.840
Hyunckel's already mastered
the Dark Armour Spear...

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.300
But I...

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:06.630
I...

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.720
Don't you get it, Dai?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:11.680
It's only natural.
Of course you can't draw it.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:18.480
The Sword of Dai can't be unsheathed
to face a retired warrior like me.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.520
If there's a reason that
you can't draw your sword...

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:27.240
it's in your inability
to properly read your opponent.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.700
The issue is in you!

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:34.490
It's... in me?

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:38.250
<i>That's it!</i>

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:41.420
<i>Ever since I sliced that giant
Sovereign Rock Castle,</i>

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:45.840
<i>I've been unconsciously
relying on the sword's power!</i>

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:51.260
<i>I mistook the power I wielded
with the sword as my own!</i>

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.600
<i>But...</i>

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.520
<i>my sword has its own soul.</i>

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:59.440
<i>It can read my enemies
far better than I can.</i>

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.360
<i>I'd forgotten that!</i>

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:08.190
<i>Only when I've fought to the limit
with my own strength,</i>

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:11.110
<i>will my sword lend its power to me!</i>

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.990
<i>Nova, seeing you fight so desperately</i>

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:20.500
<i>has made me understand
what Lon Beruk tried to teach me.</i>

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:25.670
<i>I guess we both have
a lot to learn as Heroes.</i>

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.590
There's still a way!

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:31.180
What's wrong, Dai?

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:33.680
If I still can't draw my sword,

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:37.640
it means there's still a way
to defeat them without it!

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:41.940
Dammit!

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:51.280
You and your meddling!
You'll pay for that!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:54.200
Full power Draconic Aura!

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:04.500
Dai, knock Hym this way!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:08.050
<i>That's right! I'm not the only one
who can use Air attacks!</i>

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.050
Avan Style Spear Technique!

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.260
Air Strike!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:14.890
Hym!

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:18.430
Hyunckel!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.730
Great! That's one down!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:21.890
No.

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:31.900
You still haven't mastered Air Strike?!

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:34.610
It's true that it's not an easy skill.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:38.780
But the queen spit this out,

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:41.830
shifting my aim from Hym's core.

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.790
Without this, I could have ended it.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:49.710
It's instantly fatal
depending on where you're hit.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.970
I'd suggest healing it quickly.

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:54.180
Maam!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:55.680
Maam, we need you!

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:03.430
Why you...!

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.650
Everyone gather for a moment!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:08.730
Understood.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:14.700
Squelch.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:23.450
Damn. I can't lift my arm.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.000
-Fenbren.
-Sure.

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:35.510
That makes things easier.

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:38.340
To be honest, I misjudged them.

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.560
Sorry, Albinass.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.350
I did, too.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:49.770
The Disciples of Avan have grown far more
powerful than what Lord Hadlar described.

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:53.190
Our abilities surpass theirs.

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:56.030
But their experience
makes them relentless.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.950
They can't be underestimated.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.370
You should be okay, Hyunckel.

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:01.700
Thanks.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:05.370
Hym is going to fight without an arm...

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.920
Where do they get that tenacity?!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.380
Popp has a point.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:14.380
Their solidarity and sense of purpose
are terrifyingly strong.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:18.510
But Dai, while I missed,
you were on the right track.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.760
You still have your friends.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:23.510
Don't try to do everything yourself.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:26.600
I made my own discovery.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.440
Crocodine!

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:32.860
Individually, their abilities
are far beyond our own.

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:38.200
We can't win fighting power
with power or speed with speed.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:42.330
We should fight their strengths
with different strengths.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:46.450
I get it.
Matching their strengths is no good.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:49.500
Okay! Let's switch things up!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.960
Maam, confuse the big one with your speed.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:57.470
And Big Guy, use your strength
to overpower the knight.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:02.680
Dai and Hyunckel, I need you to take
the other three at once.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:04.890
Keep together as a team!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.100
I'm going to prepare my Medroa!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:14.070
Once the knight's mirror is disabled,
try to gather them together!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:17.860
I'll be firing a huge spell,
so get some distance!

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:18.740
Got it?!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:19.780
Right!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.530
Here we go then!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.490
Beast King Redemption Blast!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.110
Okay!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.410
Pathetic!

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:08.660
You can't beat me
with an Aura Flow this weak!

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:12.920
Then how about the other whirlpool?!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:13.870
What?!

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:17.800
I risked my life
in the Valge Whirlpool for this!

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:22.840
My new attack will tear you apart!

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.930
A second twister with a reverse spin?!

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:46.320
Beast King Indomitable Blast!

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.500
Sigma!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.420
Now! Everybody scatter!

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.380
A spell won't work!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:06.090
No!

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:09.260
Medroa!

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.650
<i>W-What power!</i>

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:25.070
<i>That's worth bragging about.</i>

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.070
<i>Well done learning such a spell.</i>

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.990
<i>That's amazing, Popp!</i>

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:36.960
Popp!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.250
That was amazing!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:40.960
So that's what all that training was for!

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.460
I did it!

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:46.300
I definitely hit them this time.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:49.010
One good hit with that...

00:21:58.270 --> 00:21:59.400
and we win!

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.320
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:11.280
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:11.280
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.370
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.370
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:19.420
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:19.420
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:22.710
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.630
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:26.630
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:30.340
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:30.340
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:34.640
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:34.640
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:38.690
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:38.690
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:42.480
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:42.480
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:53.660
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:53.660
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:57.450
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:57.450
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:22:59.750
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:22:59.750
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:03.920
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:03.920
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:08.420
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:08.420
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:11.590
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:11.590
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:16.270
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:16.270
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:22.480
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:22.480
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:40.790
<i>The fierce team battle was ended
by Popp's new spell, Medroa.</i>

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:45.130
<i>Meanwhile, Chiu infiltrates
the Field of Death with his companions.</i>

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:48.710
<i>They get closer to the secret
of the Dark Army's stronghold.</i>

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:52.340
<i>But the hand of the Dark Army
reaches towards them.</i>

00:23:52.510 --> 00:23:55.050
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.220 --> 00:23:57.180
<i>"We're the Beast King Commandos"</i>

00:23:57.350 --> 00:23:59.560
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
